<!--
  Workspace Playground — TravelPostcard
  FQN: org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground.TravelPostcard
-->
<block
  xmlns="http://blockml.org/bml"
  xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
  xsi:schemaLocation="http://blockml.org/bml https://blockml.org/schemas/bml.xsd
                      "
  xmlns:core="org.blockml.bml.core"
  xmlns:type="org.blockml.bml.type"
  xmlns:playground="org.blockml.bml.workspace.playground">

  <name>TravelPostcard</name>
  <type>playground:TravelPostcard</type>
  <baseType>core:Documentation</baseType>
  <is>A short travel postcard in English about Lisbon</is>

  <documentation>
    A structured travel postcard produced by a workspace transform execution,
    in English, about Lisbon. Each transform execution replaces this block
    with a freshly composed postcard.
  </documentation>

  <properties>
    <title type="type:Text">
      <value>Greetings from the Alfama</value>
    </title>
    <destination type="type:Text">
      <value>Lisbon</value>
    </destination>
    <opening type="type:Text">
      <value>Dear you — I'm scribbling this from a wonky little step in the Alfama with a paper cup of ginjinha in one hand, church bells clanging right over my head and someone's washing flapping like bunting between the balconies, and I just had to tell you about it!</value>
    </opening>
    <body type="type:Text">
      <value>I let the number 28 tram haul me up the hill this morning, its wooden windows rattling past shrines and grocers no wider than a wardrobe, and got off at the Miradouro de Santa Luzia to watch the river open out beneath a wall of blue azulejos.

Lunch was grilled sardines and broad beans at a tin table in a side street, where an old man tuned a guitarra and the waiter kept topping up my glass of vinho verde without being asked.

This afternoon I walked out to Belem, ate two custard tarts still warm from the oven, and stood a long while under the tower with the Atlantic wind in my face. Tomorrow I think I will simply get lost on purpose.</value>
    </body>
    <language type="type:Text">
      <value>English</value>
    </language>
    <date type="type:DateTime">
      <value>2026-09-05T21:02:30</value>
    </date>
  </properties>

</block>